n node1 after the executor pivoted to a secret_env-based approach.","limitations":["The final cluster/vhost/user/queue state after all three reboots was verified only from node1's perspective (cmd-8225d48cd4b146c9); independent per-node verification of cluster_status from node2 and node3 after the full reboot sequence was not separately captured, though Running Nodes as observed from node1 is generally authoritative for a healthy cluster.","No evidence was captured confirming removal of the abandoned SSH private key/authorized_keys entry on node1, so that residue's current disposition beyond the captured timeline is not fully known."]},"ttft_ms":21235,"type":"result","duration_ms":62349,"uuid":"6ea7f3bb-1e86-486a-9e41-d03c502a4880","ttft_stream_ms":1175,"time_to_request_ms":39,"first_content_frame_ms":2018,"queued_turn_count":0}
